[Notice]
1. Subscribe to the Roaring Month to activate the Calendar and receive Crystal Drops*300 immediately;
2. While the Calendar is active, you will receive Clear Drops x90 and Picrasma Candy (time-limited) x1 when you log in to the game for the first time every day. The rewards will not be reissued if you haven't logged in that day;
3. The rewards will be renewed at 5:00 every morning. Players logging in during 5:00am to 5:00am the next day can receive their rewards of the day;
4. The Roaring Month may be purchased again within 179 days prior to its expiration date. Another 30 days will be added to the player's account upon the new purchase. The Roaring Month can be purchased repeatedly until the validity time reaches or exceeds 180 days.

